<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro Pacific says in utility consortium.</title>
<headline>Metro Pacific says in utility consortium.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Pacific Corp, the local flagship company of First Pacific Co Ltd, said on Monday it had set up a consortium to bid for the privatisation of Metropolitan Waterworks and Sewerage System (MWSS).</p>
<p>Metro Pacific said it will have a 35 percent stake in the Metro Water Corp consortium, which includes Anglian Water Overseas Holdings Inc, Australia Water Technologies Pty Limited and Strategic Alliance Development Corp.</p>
<p>The government is bidding out two concessions of Manila's water system held by MWSS.</p>
<p>Financial and technical bids for MWSS are expected to be submitted later on Monday.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
